# Build artefacts must NOT be sent to the Docker build context.
# Without this, any COPY from a repo-root context pushes the host's
# full target/ trees (hundreds of GBs of debug/release objects and
# incremental caches) into the builder — causing OOM on CI runners
# and multi-minute context-upload stalls locally.
#
# This file covers the repo-root build context used by:
#   cli/apprafter-backup/Dockerfile  (COPY cli/ ...)
# The operator/ build uses its own sibling .dockerignore (context: operator/).
cli/target/
operator/target/

# Local state and editor noise.
.git/
.gitignore
**/*.swp
**/.DS_Store
result
